      </div>
      <h1 class="art-h1">How much can I borrow against my Audemars Piguet watch in Australia?</h1>
      <p class="art-lead">
        Audemars Piguet is a manufacturer, not a single market. The published loan range is the
        starting point — the exact reference, condition, documentation and current demand decide
        what one particular watch can support.
      </p>
      <div class="art-byline">
        <div class="art-author">
          <Image class="art-avatar" src={specialistImg} alt="" widths={[42, 84]} sizes="42px" format="webp" quality={80} />
